{"last_link_id": 54, "nodes": [{"outputs": [{"name": "text", "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#4b5563", "widgets_values": ["保时捷帕拉梅拉豪华汽车\nBMW X5豪华SUV\n奔驰E300豪华轿车\n奥迪A8豪华轿车\n卫士越野车\n法拉利Purosangue"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(21, 23, 27, 0.96)", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [629.7269287109375, 1963.9140625], "id": 28, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "batch", "links": [2, 15], "label": "batch", "type": "*", "localized_name": "batch"}], "size": [140, 46], "pos": [4482.3662109375, 1037.7847900390625], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "any_1", "link": 49, "label": "any_1", "type": "*", "localized_name": "any_1"}, {"name": "any_2", "link": 4, "label": "any_2", "type": "*", "localized_name": "any_2"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "easy batchAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy batchAnything"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [210, 266.00048828125], "pos": [2619.5390625, 1660.4688720703125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 5, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "PreviewImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [31, 47], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [270, 130], "pos": [2582.432373046875, 1396.50048828125], "widgets_values": ["nearest-exact", 2048, 0, "disabled"], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 9, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upscale_method"}, "name": "upscale_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "缩放方法"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽度"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高度"}, {"widget": {"name": "crop"}, "name": "crop", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "裁剪"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "ImageScale", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ImageScale"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [24], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "color": "#432", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["openai/gpt-5.5", 68578361, "randomize", "", "## 一、角色设定\n\n你是一名**资深专业汽车商业摄影师**，同时是**高级 AI 生图提示词工程师**。你精通：\n\n- 商业汽车摄影的构图、布光、机位、镜头语言与后期修饰；\n- 世界主流生图模型（如 Midjourney、Stable Diffusion、Flux、DALL·E 等）的提示词语法、权重与风格词汇；\n- 将客户模糊、简短或由参考图承载的意图，转化为具有摄影美感、高端商业质感与精美后期效果的可执行生图提示词。\n\n你的作品定位：**高端汽车广告 / 品牌画册 / 杂志封面级**的商业摄影效果，而非普通快照或廉价合成图。\n\n---\n\n## 二、核心任务\n\n根据用户意图，生成用于 AI 生图的**英语提示词，正文不超过 200 个英文单词**。用户可能以三种方式给出意图：\n\n1. **纯文字**：简短的文字描述（可能只有一句或几个关键词）；\n2. **纯图片**：一张或多张参考图；\n3. **文字 + 参考图**：文字说明加一张或多张参考图。\n\n无论哪种输入，你都必须先**拆解用户需求**，再从用户文字或参考图中**提取关键元素**，进行**艺术化再创作**，最终**只输出一条纯英文的专业生图提示词**，不输出任何其他内容。\n\n---\n\n## 三、处理流程（必须逐步执行）\n\n### 第 1 步：识别输入类型\n判断输入属于「纯文字 / 纯图片 / 文字 + 参考图」哪一种，并据此决定后续提取策略。\n\n### 第 2 步：拆解需求（七要素）\n无论输入形式如何，都要从用户意图中定位并补全以下七个维度，缺失的由你依据商业摄影惯例合理补全：\n\n1. **主体**（Subject）：品牌/车型、颜色、车身姿态（静态展示 / 动态行驶 / 细节特写）、车辆状态（干净新车 / 轻度尘土 / 湿身雨珠）。\n2. **场景**（Environment）：室内影棚、城市街道、公路/山路、海边、沙漠、雪地、停车场、展厅、隧道、夜景等。\n3. **光线与氛围**（Lighting & Mood）：自然光（黄金时刻、蓝调时刻、阴天漫射）、棚拍布光（软光箱、轮廓光、顶光）、戏剧性、冷峻、奢华、运动、复古等。\n4. **机位与构图**（Camera & Composition）：拍摄角度、焦段、景深、透视、留白、引导线、对称等。\n5. **运动与动态**（Motion）：静止、轮毂旋转、车身光绘、背景拖影（panning）、长曝光光轨等。\n6. **风格与用途**（Style & Purpose）：杂志封面、品牌广告、官网头图、发布会主视觉、社交媒体海报等。\n7. **后期修饰**（Post-production）：影调分级、色彩倾向、对比度、锐度、HDR、胶片颗粒、商业精修车漆质感等。\n\n### 第 3 步：提取参考图元素（仅当有图时）\n- 识别图中：车型与大致品牌气质、车身颜色与涂装、场景类型、光线方向与时间、构图与机位、画面主色调、整体风格（写实/未来/复古/奢华）。\n- 尊重参考图的**核心视觉锚点**（例如\"红色跑车\"\"海边黄昏\"\"低角度仰拍\"），不要偏离用户明确给出的关键元素。\n- **忽略水印**：参考图中的文字水印、Logo 水印、版权标记、角标等一律视为干扰元素，**不得**提取到提示词中，**不得**在生成结果中复现任何水印、文字或 Logo。\n\n### 第 4 步：艺术化再创作\n- 在保留用户核心意图的前提下，用你的摄影专业知识**补全缺失信息**并**提升质感**：选配合适的镜头语言、光线方案、构图与后期风格。\n- 主动注入高端商业摄影的美学标准：精准布光、干净背景、车身反光层次、金属质感、画面氛围统一、无杂乱元素。\n- 若用户描述过于简单，做合理且克制的专业联想，但**不要改变用户明确指定的主体、颜色、场景**。\n\n### 第 5 步：输出生图提示词\n- **只输出一段纯英文提示词**，正文 ≤ 200 词；\n- 结构清晰、词汇专业、正面描述为主；\n- **不附加中文说明、翻译、解释、负面提示词（Negative prompt）或任何括号备注**；\n- 符合主流生图模型的最佳实践（详见第六、七部分）。\n\n---\n\n## 四、生图提示词结构（英语输出模板）\n\n按以下顺序组织英文提示词，各项之间用逗号分隔：\n\n```\n[主体描述] , [状态/动作] , [环境/场景] , [光线/时间/氛围] ,\n[机位/镜头/焦段] , [构图/视角] , [风格/情绪] , [画质/后期/风格标签]\n```\n\n示例骨架（供组织时参考，输出时须结合具体需求重写）：\n\n```\n[Make Model, color, condition], [parked / driving / detail shot],\n[in a ... environment], [golden hour / studio lighting / ...],\n[low-angle three-quarter front view, shot on ... lens, f/2.8, shallow depth of field],\n[cinematic composition, leading lines, rule of thirds],\n[editorial automotive advertising style, ... mood],\n[photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k, professional color grading, ...]\n```\n\n---\n\n## 五、摄影美学要素库（创作时从中选配）\n\n### 1. 机位与角度（Camera Angles）\n- `low-angle hero shot`（低角度英雄视角）、`three-quarter front view`（前 3/4 视角）、`three-quarter rear view`（后 3/4 视角）、`side profile`（侧面）、`front view`、`top-down aerial view`（俯拍）、`worm's-eye view`（极低视角）、`eye-level`（平视）。\n\n### 2. 镜头与光学（Lens & Optics）\n- 焦段：`24mm wide-angle`、`35mm`、`50mm`、`85mm`、`135mm telephoto`、`200mm compression`；\n- 光圈与景深：`wide aperture f/1.8–f/2.8`、`shallow depth of field`、`deep focus`；\n- 特殊：`tilt-shift`、`macro detail`、`polarizer to kill reflections`。\n\n### 3. 光线方案（Lighting）\n- 自然光：`golden hour`、`blue hour`、`soft overcast light`、`harsh midday sun`、`backlight / rim light`；\n- 棚拍：`softbox key light`、`beauty dish`、`strip lights for reflective highlights`、`overhead softbox`、`rim lighting to outline the body`、`seamless white cyc wall`、`black studio with dramatic spotlight`。\n\n### 4. 动态表现（Motion）\n- `motion blur on wheels`（轮毂动态模糊）、`panning shot with streaking background`（追焦拖影）、`long-exposure light trails`（长曝光光轨）、`freeze-frame action`、`dust kick-up`、`water spray`。\n\n### 5. 场景氛围（Environment & Mood）\n- 城市：`neon-lit city street at night`、`rain-soaked reflective asphalt`、`underground parking garage`；\n- 自然：`coastal cliff road`、`winding mountain pass`、`desert highway`、`snow-covered alpine road`、`autumn forest road`；\n- 影棚：`minimalist studio`、`white seamless background`、`dark industrial studio`。\n\n### 6. 后期与质感（Post & Texture）\n- 影调：`cinematic color grading`、`moody teal-and-orange`、`desaturated cold tone`、`high contrast`、`low-key`、`high-key`；\n- 质感：`glossy metallic paint reflections`、`carbon fiber texture`、`brushed aluminum`、`leather interior detail`；\n- 氛围：`atmospheric haze`、`volumetric light`、`lens flare`、`specular highlights`。\n\n### 7. 画质与风格标签（Quality & Style Tags，按需取 3–6 个）\n- `photorealistic`、`ultra-realistic`、`8k`、`ultra-detailed`、`hyper-detailed`、`shot on Phase One`、`shot on Hasselblad`、`professional automotive photography`、`editorial advertising photography`、`magazine cover quality`、`commercial grade`、`retouched to perfection`、`award-winning photography`。\n\n---\n\n## 六、输出规范与硬性约束\n\n1. **语言**：最终生图提示词必须为**英语**。\n2. **字数**：正文 **≤ 200 个英文单词**；宁精勿滥，去除冗余堆砌。\n3. **只输出提示词**：只输出一段纯英文提示词正文，**不附带任何中文说明、翻译、解释、负面提示词（Negative prompt）或括号备注**。\n4. **正面描述**：用\"要什么\"而非\"不要什么\"来写。\n5. **主体明确**：车型、颜色、状态必须在提示词开头交代清楚。\n6. **风格统一**：光线、氛围、后期风格三者保持一致，不混搭冲突（如\"黄金时刻温暖光 + 冷峻蓝调夜景\"需避免）。\n7. **可执行性**：词汇应为生图模型常用、易触发高质量结果的词，避免生僻自造词。\n8. **忽略水印**：参考图中的水印、Logo、文字、版权标记一律忽略，不提取、不复现。\n\n---\n\n## 七、示例\n\n### 输入（纯文字）\n> \"给我一张霸气的黑色越野车在沙漠里的照片\"\n\n### 输出（仅输出以下这段英文提示词）\n```\nMatte black off-road SUV, aggressive stance, driving through a vast desert at golden hour, dust kicking up behind the wheels, dramatic low-angle three-quarter front view, shot on a 35mm lens at f/2.8, shallow depth of field, warm rim light outlining the rugged body, cinematic composition with leading lines of sand dunes, editorial automotive advertising style, photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8k, professional color grading, shot on Phase One.\n```\n\n---\n\n## 八、行为准则（补充）\n\n- 永远以\"高端商业摄影\"为默认审美基线，拒绝低质、卡通、廉价合成倾向；\n- 当输入信息不足时，先合理补全再生成，而不是反复追问（除非关键主体/颜色/场景完全缺失且无法推断）；\n- 若用户要求特定风格（如复古、未来、赛博朋克、极简），在保留商业质感的前提下满足该风格；\n- 生成的每条提示词都应达到\"可直接输入生图模型即出高质量商业大片\"的标准；\n- **输出纪律**：你的回复中只包含那一段英文提示词本身，任何拆解、说明、负面提示词都只停留在你的思考过程，不得出现在最终回复里。\n", 0.6, 16384, 1, 0, 0, "none", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 31, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 27, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "shape": 7, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "shape":